    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1692">

                <pb facs="1335" n="1325" xml:id="pg1325"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">119.2/10–2949: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Second Secretary of Embassy in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bacon</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">at
                        Nanking</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-15T19:00:00-05:00">November 15,
                            1949—7 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1234. Urtel 2330, Oct 29. Trans[fer] radio equipment Commies prohibited by
                    reg[ulation]s and in accordance Depcirtel Sep 14, para 4M.<anchor n="67"
                        xml:id="d1692-f1"/> Although refcirtel intended as general Admin instr all
                    China posts, it was not sent Tihwa view earlier closure that office. Therefore,
                    probable Brit Con Tihwa not aware provision that radio equipment shld not be
                    allowed fall into Commie hands intact.</p>
                <p>In discussing matter with Brit Emb you may point out that obviously Commies wld
                    use radio equipment to further anti-Amer propaganda. If radio equipment not
                    already mutilated and inexpedient do so now, and if Commies arbitrarily seize,
                    inform Dept.</p>
                <p>Dept leaves to ur discretion in consultation Brit Emb nature reply to be sent
                    Brit Con Tihwa. Brit Emb Wash informs Dept Brit Con Tihwa desires instr in plain
                    text, via commercial channels.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
